OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sun 18 Oct to Tue 27 Oct
OL,6,FHigh pressure is expected to lie close
OL,7,Fto or across the UK through much of
OL,8,Fthis period. This will mean largely
OL,9,Ffine and dry weather for many, perhaps
OL,10,Fwith some overnight mist and fog
OL,11,Fpatches. Weak frontal systems could
OL,12,Fbring some rain from the west and
OL,13,Fshowers may spread in from eastern
OL,14,Fcoasts at times. Winds are expected to
OL,15,Fbe mostly light. Temperatures will
OL,16,Flikely be around normal for the time
OL,17,Fof year, with frosty mornings in the
OL,18,Fusual prone areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
